      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/{size}/1946_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-25T14:23:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I actually haven’t given much dedicated thought to that, but it’s coming to me now that I do. A few of them are obvious - Ra has it on one of his cards, Absolute Zero doesn’t have a whole lot of options, Tachyon actually wears her civvies under her lab coat on Research Grant but it’s pretty much waist-up. Given the character’s origins, she’s dressed business formal almost all the time. Bunker has his fatigues, Tempest I assume has some sort of holographic normal-person camoflage, Legacy has normal street clothes (even though he’s shown in his kitchen with his costume on). Wraith does formal for social events but business casual for the day-to-day grind. I actually have no idea about Haka, Visionary, or Fanatic. I wouldn’t be surprised if Fanatic sleeps in her armor.</p>",
