      "name": "beevolant",
      "username": "beevolant",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/8edcca/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-25T23:28:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Having worked in an academic research setting, I think that Dr. Stinson could totally get away with those shoes. I imagine that particle physics labs are not high on chemicals/biohazards, and the shoes are closed toed so they pass OSHA. Plus, she probably spends a lot of time in meetings as she apparently has all of her funding from the feds and they love their meetings.</p>\n<p>I imagine The Wraith wears suits with vests to the office, and my guess is that she’s not big on heels (butt kicking is severely impeded by high heels).</p>\n<p>I call Paul Parsons as a Bill-Cosby-Sweater wearer.</p>",
